Hi {Owner},

I build websites for home care agencies around {City}. {Business Name} has kind words from families on Google, but no site where an adult child can understand your care levels and costs, or where a caregiver can apply from a phone.

I built a sample first rather than ask for your time: levels of care explained, how caregivers are screened and matched, paying for care, the towns you cover, a family care request and a caregiver careers page with a short application. It uses marked placeholders where your photos would go:

{demo-link}

If you want it, I move it to a domain you own and finish it for {Build Range}, plus {Care Range} a month for hosting and updates. If not, no problem, it comes down at the end of the month.

Worth fifteen minutes this week?

{Your Name}
{Your Studio} · {Your Phone}
{Your Physical Address}

Reply "stop" and I won't contact you again.
